{"name":"Blush Kiss","hex":"#eabcc0","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blush","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An act of blushing; a pink or red glow on the face caused by embarrassment, shame, shyness, love, etc.","A glow; a flush of colour, especially pink or red."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To become red or pink in the face (and sometimes experience an associated feeling of warmth), especially due to shyness, love, shame, excitement, or embarrassment.","To be shy, ashamed, or embarrassed (to do something)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blush"},{"term":"kiss","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To touch with the lips or press the lips against, usually to show love or affection or passion, or as part of a greeting.","To (cause to) touch lightly or slightly; to come into contact."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A touch with the lips, usually to express love or affection, or as a greeting.","An 'X' mark placed at the end of a letter or other type of message, signifying the bestowal of a kiss from the sender to the receiver."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/kiss"}],"entries":[{"title":"Blush (EP)","blocks":[{"text":"Blush is the second extended play (EP) by English alternative rock band Wolf Alice. It was released on 7 October 2013 by Chess Club Records. The EP was produced by Austen Jux-Chandler. \"She\" was the first song to come from the EP, which was uploaded to the band's SoundCloud page."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/5d/Wolf_Alice_-_Blush.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blush_(EP)","wikidata":"Q16244453"},{"title":"Kiss","blocks":[{"text":"A kiss is the touching or pressing of one's lips against another person, animal, or object. The cultural connotations associated with kissing vary significantly between different societies and contexts. Depending on the culture and circumstances, a kiss can express a wide range of emotions, such as love, passion, romance, sexual attraction, sexual arousal, affection, respect, a wish for peace or good luck, as well as numerous other meanings. In some situations, kissing takes on the function of a greeting or a ritual, formal, or symbolic gesture indicating religious devotion, institutional respect, or an act of sacramental nature."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Cassatt_Mary_Maternal_Kiss_1896.jpg/330px-Cassatt_Mary_Maternal_Kiss_1896.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiss","wikidata":"Q7307"},{"title":"Blush (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Blush is a medium bright tone of pink."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Blush_rose_1.jpg/330px-Blush_rose_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blush_(color)","wikidata":"Q22133966"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/USMC-16853.jpg/500px-USMC-16853.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/USMC-16853.jpg/1280px-USMC-16853.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/USMC-16853.jpg/500px-USMC-16853.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A forehead kiss","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUSMC-16853.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/US_Navy_060105-N-3019M-002_Boatswain%27s_Mate_3rd_Class_Leroy_Quinn_kisses_his_son_on_the_pier_before_departing_aboard_the_guided_missile_destroyer_USS_Chung-Hoon_%28DDG_93%29.jpg/500px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.